{"overview":"در این افسانهٔ جادویی و کمی شکسته، پرنسس زیبا به نام باترکاپ و وستلی شجاع باید بر خلاف تمام موانع، از جمله شمشیرزن‌های شش‌انگشتی، شاهزادگان خون‌آشام، سیسیلی‌ها و موش‌های بزرگ‌جثه، به خوشبختی برسند. اما حتی مرگ هم نمی‌تواند این پرنده‌های عشق واقعی را از پیروزی بازدارد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"In this enchantingly cracked fairy tale, the beautiful Princess Buttercup and the dashing Westley must overcome staggering odds to find happiness amid six-fingered swordsmen, murderous princes, Sicilians and rodents of unusual size. But even death can't stop these true lovebirds from triumphing.","tagline_en":"It's as real as the feelings you feel.","runtime":99,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["راب رینر"],"crew_en":["Rob Reiner"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"کری الویس","role":"Westley","photo":"/9UszBdQJ9PmyBydIeIBxlStozhW.jpg","en":"Cary Elwes"},{"name":"رابین رایت","role":"The Princess Bride","photo":"/d3rIv0y2p0jMsQ7ViR7O1606NZa.jpg","en":"Robin Wright"},{"name":"Mandy Patinkin","role":"Inigo Montoya","photo":"/1PeZ6roZvkcoyZZbvoSIWTgGe3a.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Sarandon","role":"Prince Humperdinck","photo":"/jP92Lq3JHl8mbdxzcZ6PyCQDwa5.jpg"},{"name":"Christopher Guest","role":"Count Rugen","photo":"/ofLhsKLZ4YAet8XIsNj7oA3blgh.jpg"},{"name":"والاس شاون","role":"Vizzini","photo":"/wVaM1WlFKDce4esThwL4XtNLhOe.jpg","en":"Wallace Shawn"},{"name":"André Roussimoff","role":"Fezzik","photo":"/A1A3RjFq5e0QghWU3vLrhyQdjwu.jpg"},{"name":"Fred Savage","role":"The Grandson","photo":"/ux4TBPjG2kZDUlDiKb6eBK7BBFl.jpg"},{"name":"Peter Falk","role":"The Grandfather","photo":"/e59x8ITouNlyz8Qa2abb5lxiQvI.jpg"},{"name":"Peter Cook","role":"The Impressive Clergyman","photo":"/wytpiTl3Wgr3T2kdMgcP88WIbLu.jpg"},{"name":"Mel Smith","role":"The Albino","photo":"/vynnJ4jWZvGRClXTN4kFQqTEIdn.jpg"},{"name":"Carol Kane","role":"Valerie","photo":"/dm3Ci8XuVYZBqqlYtaLgth94VUe.jpg"}],"trailer":"ltpgBg-duQE","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/m